      <p class="_abstract">Control plane machine sets automate several essential aspects of control plane management to reduce operational overhead and ensure consistency.</p>
      <h2 id="cpmso-feat-config-update_cpmso-managing-machines" class="group scroll-mt-20">Updating the control plane configuration<a href="#cpmso-feat-config-update_cpmso-managing-machines" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Update the control plane machine set specification to modify control plane machine configuration and trigger automatic or manual replacements.</p>
      <p>The Control Plane Machine Set Operator monitors the control plane machines and compares their configuration with the specification in the control plane machine set CR. When there is a discrepancy between the specification in the CR and the configuration of a control plane machine, the Operator marks that control plane machine for replacement.</p>
